1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 4 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das provas de trail \u00e0s 09:15 e da caminhada \u00e0s 10:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localizam a partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as partidas e chegadas est\u00e3o centralizadas no Parque de Lazer da Vila de Roriz, em Santo Tirso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa disp\u00f5e de Trail Longo de 20 km, Trail Curto de 12 km (ambos com cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica e classifica\u00e7\u00e3o) e Caminhada de lazer.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica (trails), abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos de refor\u00e7o, balne\u00e1rios com duches no final e seguros desportivos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma oficial SincTime at\u00e9 ao dia 27 de setembro de 2026 ou at\u00e9 esgotar o limite de 800 participantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail dos Carreteiros 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-04\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque de Lazer da Vila de Roriz, Santo Tirso\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santo Tirso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o RorizAventura\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o IX Trail dos Carreteiros 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 4 de outubro de 2026, com in\u00edcio das provas de trail \u00e0s 09:15 e da caminhada \u00e0s 10:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localizam a partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@ty